Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: desk.cpl: Scale the appearance and screen saver previews to the DPI.
 The window preview of the Appearance page, the colour buttons of the
 advanced appearance dialog and the screen saver preview inside the
 monitor picture were laid out in fixed pixels. Scale them to the screen
 DPI; at 96 DPI the screen saver preview keeps its rectangle.
